2026-11-07T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-2470) 'the blocks_gtn domain, its frontier harness, and the MiniZinc checker that grades it.
 # tags: rfd:scope, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2470  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-2470) 'Can a plan the GTN (goal-task network) finds for the Challenge's blocks-world also be the minimum, checked by the Challenge's own tool, climbing from the smallest instance up?
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2470  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2470) 'GTPyhop's blocks_gtn is already ported, with take, put and moveblocks as a KHR_interactivity graph, and shortestOf already finds the optimal six actions for the Sussman anomaly. A separate reference tool already matched a breadth-first minimum for n = 3 to 7 on 3 piles, in times climbing from about 15 ms to about 4 s, but the domain still has no pile limit, no climbing harness and no run against the real checker.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2470  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2470) 'Install MiniZinc, replay a solved instance through it, and confirm the checker accepts the plan as valid and minimum; a plan with one move removed must be refused by the same checker.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2470  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2470) 'MiniZinc Challenge: blocks-world on the GTN blocks methods
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2470  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2470) 'Encode the model's pile limit, k piles with at most k cubes on the table, in the GTN domain, then climb: generate instances at n = 3, 4, 5 and up with the model's k, record solve time at each step, and stop at the frontier where the time makes the next step not worth running yet. Add a heuristic lower bound, for instance the count of cubes already out of place, to prune the five official instances (16 cubes on 4 piles), which are far past what iterative deepening alone can reach. Validate every plan against MiniZinc itself, installed locally, rather than against the reference tool alone.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2470  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2470) '- RFD66606-2339, where a persona answers from a goal-task network and exports a plan.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2470  1 LINE
 Text:Written

