 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2470) '- On branch parked/minizinc-blocks-frontier, tools/minizinc/ holds an instance generator, an independent breadth-first minimum, and a replay against the model's rules. For n = 3 to 7 on 3 piles, 20 random instances each matched the minimum and replayed validly, at a cost climbing from about 15 ms at n = 5 to about 4 s at n = 7.
 # tags: rfd:details
